  type_object_property_virtual_err_default_plain.pcpp - break step of type_object_property_virtual.pcpp:
  default names an indexed property (SM0379)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_property_virtual_err_default_plain.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_property_virtual_err_default_plain.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
